{# ============================================================ ACADEMIC NETWORK (register)
   Moved 2026-09-01 from a homepage section into Admizz Education's own
   venture record on /ventures/ (see ventures/index.njk, included only when
   v.id == "education") -- this is that venture's own proof point, not a
   whole-group claim, so it belongs on that record rather than the
   homepage. The homepage now shows a curated sample instead (see the
   "ACADEMIC NETWORK SPOTLIGHT" section in index.njk) with a link back to
   this full list.

   Country-by-country register, same idiom as /ventures/'s numbered
   records and this site's .data-row component. Each row expands via
   Alpine's collapse plugin into a real tile grid -- a directory entry,
   not a marketing wall. Tile styling (no border, no name text under the
   logo, full color always) is shared with the homepage spotlight grid via
   .academic-network-tile / .academic-spotlight-tile in main.css, kept in
   sync after direct comparison against rillet.com's actual grid. #}
<div class="mt-16 pt-14 border-t border-rule" id="network">
  <div class="max-w-[42rem] fade-up">
    <span class="eyebrow">Global Network</span>
    <h3 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h3 text-ink">{{ universities.totalCount }} partner institutions, {{ universities.groups.length }} countries.</h3>
    <p class="mt-4 text-body text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight">
      The full academic network behind Admizz Education's admissions work, indexed by country. Figures and partner names published by Admizz Education, as of 2026.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 fade-up" style="animation-delay:90ms" x-data="{ open: null }">
    {% for group in universities.groups %}
    <div>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="academic-network-row"
        @click="open = open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? null : {{ loop.index0 }}"
        :aria-expanded="open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? 'true' : 'false'"
        aria-controls="network-panel-{{ group.code }}"
      >
        <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-body" aria-hidden="true">{{ group.flag }}</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-small uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">{{ group.country }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="font-mono text-small text-ink-faint">{{ group.universities.length }} institution{{ "s" if group.universities.length != 1 }}</span>
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
            class="academic-network-chevron text-ink-faint transition-transform duration-press ease-signature"
            :class="open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? 'rotate-180' : ''">
            <path d="M2.5 4.5L6 8l3.5-3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </button>
      <div id="network-panel-{{ group.code }}" x-show="open === {{ loop.index0 }}" x-collapse x-cloak>
        <ul class="academic-network-grid" :class="open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? 'is-open' : ''">
          {% for u in group.universities %}
          <li class="academic-network-tile" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}">
            <span class="academic-network-tile-flag" aria-hidden="true">{{ group.flag }}</span>
            <img src="{{ u.logo }}" alt="{{ u.name }}" loading="lazy">
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
